  "scope": "Fix the six documented remaining move issues, plus three cross-action history moves; add the already implemented Aqua Jet to CS. Shared engine, Adventure wild/trainers/PvP, Rift/Colosseum and Super Tournament. Closed modes remain closed.",
  "rules": {
    "Rollout / Ice Ball": "30/60/120/240/480 power; five forced successful turns, initial PP cost only; Defense Curl doubles the chain; misses, protection, status prevention, immunity, switching and KO end/reset it. A target KO does not cancel the remaining chain.",
    "Fury Cutter": "40/80/160, capped at 160; normal PP per attack; resets after another move, interruption, miss, protection, switching or a skipped turn.",
    "Echoed Voice": "40 to 200, field-wide consecutive-turn chain; increments at most once per round for both sides. A failed hit still counts as an attempt; a turn with no attempt resets the chain.",
    "Pursuit": "40 normally, 80 before a committed manual withdrawal or a faster pivot, against the outgoing Pokemon. Interception ignores accuracy/evasion, consumes the queued action once, preserves KO/replacement/residual/presentation order. No double hit on the replacement. Already-used Pursuit does not intercept again. Transient Symbol is excluded from checkpoint serialization.",
    "Fling": "Existing berries apply their HP/status/confusion/PP/stat effect to the hit target, without consuming its equipment. Substitute/protection/immunity block the effect; a KO target is not healed. Eaten-berry history, Cheek Pouch, Unnerve and Heal Block are handled; current failed-throw item-retention adaptation is retained.",
    "Retaliate": "Doubles only following a KO on the same side in the preceding round. Direct damage, residual damage, recoil and entry hazards count. A second KO in the current round does not erase a preceding-round KO.",
    "Fusion Bolt / Fusion Flare": "Second complementary move doubles only if the last successful move in this same turn was the other one; no previous-turn or failed-move carryover."
  },
